{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830710/extras/ca532aa50280c7f29555966aa0b5d5b2.avif?t=1756754969\" width=616 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and activate the hidden effects of an ever-changing pyramid in this minesweeper-like game of mystery boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 200 unique items of varying rarity to unlock, each round could be over in a single click, or it could take a whole lot of equipping, unequipping, using, revealing, morphing, and breaking items to win it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix it up with different board types that overhaul the rules of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet charming characters who offer special items to help maximize your win streaks, ensuring no two rounds of Vexbox are the same!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830710?t=1756754969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830710?t=1756754969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830710/a87cd5c16c0734c62a1726072f74573c411d0336/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756754969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830710/a87cd5c16c0734c62a1726072f74573c411d0336/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756754969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas